<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JULY 22.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JULY 22.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Kuku Raadio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- Estonian forests are still in danger from fires.</p>
<p>- Microsoft was the first international software company to localise its software for Estonians.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
